e reports it"] [715 37 "// the reader's warnings, emitted once the interpreter stands (queue 228)"] [720 3 "// the coding spec is a codec of Python's the host has no charset for: decoded and compiled below"] [731 2 "// sys.path[0] as CPython's config computes sys_path_0 (sys is made from configPath on its first use; queue 250):"] [732 2 "// none under -P (safe_path), \"\" for -c and stdin, the working directory for -m, else the script's directory"] [810 4 "// a file's parser has no source string (tok->str NULL): _metadata's source None, traceback reads the file"] [825 3 "// -c's sys.path[0] \"\" (none under -P: the first entry is then the standard library's; queue 250)"] [840 22 "// handle_system_exit drops the exception before Py_FinalizeEx"] [853 2 "// Py_FinalizeEx (pylifecycle.go, queue 253): threading._shutdown, the atexit functions, the modules' end; under -i"] [854 2 "// the REPL first (queue 289)"] [858 1 "// ExecModuleFile is ExecModule with __file__."] [859 1 "// execMain runs the program's main module as pymain_run_command and pymain_run_file do (py-mods-1122): __main__'s"] [860 1 "// namespace with pylifecycle's add_main_module names first (__name__, __doc__, __package__ None, __loader__"] [861 1 "// importlib's BuiltinImporter, __spec__ None), then a file's __file__ with __cached__ None and, but for the program"] [862 1 "// read from stdin, its loader a SourceFileLoader (_PyRun_SimpleFileObject's set_main_loader): multiprocessing's spawn"] [863 1 "// reads __main__.__spec__ to find the main module again (test_multiprocessing_main_handling's scripts: \"module"] [864 1 "// '__main__' has no attribute '__spec__'\"). file \"\": -c's code (no __file__)."] [917 1 "// runIn runs code as a module's body in the namespace g."] [920 44 "// an inlined comprehension's hidden locals"] [932 1 "// systemExitStatus is handle_system_exit's exit status (pythonrun.c): the exception's code (its one argument, the tuple"] [933 1 "// of several), None 0, an int as C's int (a v